OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy overnight with some rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, falling especially over
OL,8,Fnorthern and western higher ground.
OL,9,FSome clearer and drier spells likely
OL,10,Facross most eastern areas. Remaining
OL,11,Fwindy. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FCloudy for many parts with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain,
OL,15,Fespecially in the west. Drier with
OL,16,Fsome brightness in the east. Winds
OL,17,Feasing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
