OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FTuesday, outbreaks of rain,
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy, clearing later.
OL,8,FEarly sunny spells Wednesday then
OL,9,Fshowers. Mostly dry Thursday with
OL,10,Fsunny spells, but showers near coasts.
OL,11,FTurning cooler with possible overnight
OL,12,Ffrosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
